  "reasoning": "The defendant, a government official, accepted cash, shopping cards and gold in exchange for using his position to benefit others – this is bribery (受贿). He also diverted public funds from a state‑owned housing construction company to lend to a private individual without proper authorization – this is embezzlement of public funds (挪用公款). Finally, his personal assets far exceed his lawful income and a large portion cannot be explained, which constitutes the crime of having unexplained huge assets (非法占有的巨额财产来源不明).",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿;挪用公款;非法占有的巨额财产来源不明<eoa>"
